This is a non working _non released_ set of Chat doors, use as you like.
The three #?.c files use three different methods of pissing of both Sysop and
user a like.

To compile the source, you'll need SAS C 6.X.

To install it, just use sumthin' akin to this:

  KEY  FUNCTION  EXTRAS  LOW  HIGH   PATH/FILENAME
   C      34       0     10   10000  DOORS:Nice_Chat/Nice_Chat


Test these from local, (ie nullmodem), otherwise you'll be twitting users 
left, right and center >-]


